ler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2025/11/7/Marcus_Caldeira_2.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Former West Virginia University men's soccer player Marcus Caldeira has been called to the Canada Men's National Team for its friendly against the United States on Tuesday, Oct. 6. The game will be played at Allianz Field in St. Paul, Minnesota, home of Caldeira's Minnesota United FC.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2025/11/7/Marcus_Caldeira_2.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2025/11/7/Marcus_Caldeira_2.jpg"><media:title>Marcus Caldeira</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2025/11/7/Marcus_Caldeira_2.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 5 Oct 2026 14:50:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59491</s:story_id></item><item><title>Cincinnati Game to be Televised at Noon on TNT/TruTV/HBO Max</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/5/football-cincinnati-game-to-be-televised-at-noon-on-tnt-trutv-hbo-max</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/5/football-cincinnati-game-to-be-televised-at-noon-on-tnt-trutv-hbo-max</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVUUCGame-26" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/5/WebSizeGametimeAnnouncement-W7.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that WVU's Oct. 17 Big 12 Conference football home game against Cincinnati will be televised at noon, ET, on TNT and simulcast on TruTV and HBO Max.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/1